  "patch_sha256": "9d75121115bc167fca2f290908fad3f29eee34c59371fb970d892642a9895ffa",
  "stage": "Unexposed transaction consumers only; Approve/review/choices/tracks durable HTTP still refused. Merge propagation and frontend are not included.",
  "atomicity": "Canonical group review + context/manual/choice evidence + request step now commit together; track hashes/confirmations + step commit together. Reopening a partial review skips its committed mutation without a new revision. Private AudioJobs enqueue binds request/current book/source/head and commits final context + pending job + optional explicit English-name rule + final decision receipt in one transaction. Injected receipt failure rolls back all effects. Disjoint approval dependencies remain; fully overlapping superseded owners no longer strand approval.",
  "results": "C1 correction: exact normalized semantic inputs are included in each step input hash, explicit user review/track/choice fields must equal the immutable accepted payload, and current revision must be exactly explained by the compatible head/predecessor receipts. Changed canonical values/replay and unrelated same-fingerprint revisions refuse without discarding intent. 35-case affected cohort passed19.420s/nativezero, then final21-case binding/rollback/ledger/actualApprove cohort passed9.949s/nativezero after exact receipt DTO and disjoint older-Approve names projection additions. Ancillary actual Approve proof uses separately WIP Merge propagation, outside this six-file freeze; no final whole-feature claim. Faults exercise review/context rollback, track/hash rollback, queued job/approval/rule rollback and restart partial-review replay. Existing public evidence actor/HTTPS/time validators unchanged; curated Tolkien dispatch preserved.",
  "scope": "Private fixtures only, no live/source Z/API/focus, no full/build/release. Six paths frozen for bounded review while Merge propagation continues in separate files.",
